# SCIFI Finance SPICE Token Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for SCIFI Finance.

SCIFI Finance is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token smart contract security reference connected to SPICE token infrastructure.

## Audit Information

Project: SCIFI Finance  
Audit type: SPICE token smart contract audit and certificates  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

